@ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5191

### 1. Log in as the seeded admin (copy "token" from the response into @adminToken below)
### Use the email/password you put in User Secrets as SeedAdmin:Email / SeedAdmin:Password.
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@clinicbook.local",
  "password": "<your-SeedAdmin-password>"
}

@adminToken = paste-the-admin-token-here
@doctorToken = paste-the-doctor-token-here
@patientToken = paste-the-patient-token-here

### 2. Public: list specialties
GET {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/specialties

### 3. Admin: create a doctor (this also creates their login account)
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Dr Mona Salem",
  "email": "mona.salem@clinicbook.local",
  "password": "Doctor123!",
  "specialtyId": 2,
  "bio": "Cardiologist with an interest in preventive care.",
  "consultationFee": 300.00
}

### 4. Log in as that doctor
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mona.salem@clinicbook.local",
  "password": "Doctor123!"
}

### 5. Doctor: add a recurring weekly working window (0 = Sunday ... 6 = Saturday)
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors/1/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "dayOfWeek": 1,
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "12:00:00",
  "slotMinutes": 30
}

### 6. Public: the doctor's weekly schedule
GET {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors/1/schedules

### 7. Public: free slots on a date (must be a date with a schedule, e.g. a Monday)
GET {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors/1/available-slots?date=2026-10-05

### 8. Register as a patient
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sara Ali",
  "email": "sara.ali@example.com",
  "password": "Patient123!",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-04-17",
  "phoneNumber": "0123456789"
}

### 9. Patient: book one of the free slots
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T09:00:00",
  "reason": "Chest pain for two days"
}

### 10. Booking the same slot again returns 409 Conflict
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-10-05T09:00:00"
}

### 11. My appointments (works for both patients and doctors)
GET {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 12. Cancel an appointment (frees the slot, keeps the record)
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 13. Doctor: complete a visit and store notes
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/2/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

{
  "doctorNotes": "Prescribed rest for two days."
}

### 14. Doctor: patient did not turn up
POST {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/2/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 15. Who am I?
GET {{ClinicBook.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
